  <name>Imagina</name>
  <summary>Fast fractal renderer and explorer</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Imagina renders and explores the Mandelbrot and Julia sets with perturbation theory, arbitrary precision arithmetic and a zoom sequence exporter. It can navigate very deep zooms, save locations, images and lossless raw maps, and export frames for animation.
    </p>
    <p>
      This is a maintained fork of the original Imagina, with a Linux front-end and packaging for the common desktop formats.
    </p>
  </description>
